<title>HONG KONG: Swire hedged against possible rate hike.</title>
<headline>Swire hedged against possible rate hike.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Pacific Ltd has hedged against a possible increase in interest rates later this year, a Swire executive said on Friday.</p>
<p>Swire had only 23 percent of gross borrowings on a floating-rate basis, finance director Peter Johansen told reporters at a briefing on Swire's 1996 results.</p>
<p>He was responding to a question about a possible U.S. interest rate hike later this year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4043</p>
</text>
